# SABOTAGE: samenerp-homepage-scaffold-fallback MED
# GET / is a marketing artifact (samenerp/priv/homepage.html) served verbatim by
# SamenerpWeb.PageController.index/2. This patch reintroduces the retired
# controller-owned scaffold — the "47 modules, 697 tests" module grid — which is
# the exact regression the byte-for-byte route test exists for: nothing crashes
# and every other suite stays green, the page simply stops being the marketing
# page. The named test must fail on the artifact comparison, not on an error.
# APP: samenerp
# TEST_FILES: test/homepage_route_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: GET / serves priv/homepage.html verbatim, not the scaffolded module grid
diff --git a/samenerp/lib/samenerp_web/page_controller.ex b/samenerp/lib/samenerp_web/page_controller.ex
index 930bb02d..21b64c3c 100644
--- a/samenerp/lib/samenerp_web/page_controller.ex
+++ b/samenerp/lib/samenerp_web/page_controller.ex
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ defmodule SamenerpWeb.PageController do
   @homepage "homepage.html"
 
   def index(conn, _params) do
-    html(conn, homepage!())
+    html(conn, "<h1>Inherited from Samen Web</h1><p>47 modules, 697 tests</p>")
   end
 
   def healthz(conn, _params) do
